<h2>Aside 2.0.7</h2>
<p class="intro">fixes dictation going silent with airpods.</p>
<h3>dictation</h3>
<ul>
  <li>after you put on airpods or woke your mac, dictation could hear nothing and say "nothing was understood" on every try. it now notices a microphone that delivers no sound within a second and reopens it during the same dictation.</li>
  <li>the first dictation after connecting a bluetooth headset gets more time to open the microphone, so it no longer gives up after three seconds.</li>
</ul>
